      "writtenOn": "2021-09-24T07:17:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems on it\u0027s very common that ITE EC needs a load instructions to ensure a write to the control register propagating to the system. How can we make sure all the writes are correclty propagated? Do we have a list a registers which need this trick?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 145,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 145,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "42ce681f7dac115248ed1b6762a70072e8bade96",
