        "id": 1153134
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-24T08:15:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Mostly we use barrier instruction to guarantee modification can be seen by any following instructions. See the below line 171. But it doesn\u0027t apply to EC registers.\n\nIf there is no barrier instruction in the function, we don\u0027t need to care about setting is taken into a register or not.",
      "parentUuid": "7571d2f2_c95cfb24",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 145,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 145,
        "endChar": 33
      },
